<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93029" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σάγμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σάττω</span>) mostly in
		pl., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>covering, clothing</i>,
			esp. 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σάγος</span>
			, <i>large cloak</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1142
			</span></i>; <i>covering of a shield</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				617
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				574
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> later, 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαγή</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, <i>pack-saddle,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ostr.Bodl.
				i321
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				15.1.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				326
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ς. τῶν ὑποζυγίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pomp.</u>
					41
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Arat.</u>
				25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς καμήλου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ge.</u>
					31.34
				</span></i>
			; cj. in <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				463
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>pile</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cat.Ma.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			.</div>
